Algorithm 13 GPU-Optimized Implementation of GATr
Input: Batch of multivectors $\mathbf{M} \in \mathbb{R}^{B \times N \times 16}$
function GATrFORWARDGPU($\mathbf{M}$)
    // Phase 1: Parallel projections
        $Q, K, V = \text{ParallelLinear}(\mathbf{M})$ $\triangleright O(BN)$ threads
    // Phase 2: Attention with Clifford products
        Scores = BatchGeometricProduct($Q, K^T$) $\triangleright$ Vectorized
        Attn = Softmax(ScalarPart(Scores))
    // Phase 3: Equivariant aggregation
        Output = BatchGeometricProduct(Attn, $V$)
    return Output
end function
